6t	Untitled	A deep drag of something burning and a slow drink of something cool sooth us on our ever-march towards the sky. In our conquest for the moon we have forgotten to notice the stars. Worse, we have abandoned our sun. We have turned our back on the guiding light of our paths and follow the shadows cast. Puppeteers of ourselves defined by our sharpest edges and easiest fields of perception. \n\nA Petrova line of nonfictional creation, we beam the brightest part of ourselves and deposit it to continue the menial task of proving existence. An ugly mitosis with no goal other than doing it again. There's more to it all than doing it, being seen doing it, being known to do it, and doing it again. The process was meant to be absorbed. If we were designed to do it again at constant, do it again as the final product, we would be more machine than flesh and bone.\n\nInstead of mustering the iron within myself to forge weapon against challenges lurking in the dark, why not allocate it as conduit for the fire to light the way forward and let forward see me coming as I am. Instead of a dark stretch looming into the places i'm yet to be, why not a glow announcing the arrival of another? \n\n	4f97c185-837f-4deb-a819-b96fea4fdeed	2026-01-29 20:13:31.913757+00	2026-01-29 20:13:31.913757+00	t	f	f	\N	f	f
