552	I	I want to consume, I want to be consumed, every bit of me I want to be filled with the presence of love at every point where my skin touches the air. \nI want to feel the heat, the tenderness, the energy of another soul. I want to grip it and suffocate it into myself. I never want anything to get away. \n\nI’m so subservient to my base desires. I need attention, I crave it have to have I need to be overwhelmed by it I need to be drunk on it I need to be manic for it, because of it I can do so much and without it I’m dead. I need it to fill myself, I need it to function. My soul needs to burn with affection and desire. I must be loved, I must love. Even I grow to hate, even to the point where violent I should still love. Everything needs to wrap back around to the promise that was made upon the first consumption, upon the first love. If I grow to hate I should love anyway. Hate with spite and frustration and take it out on each other out of the need to love one another. Hurt each other, hit each other, damage each others body to the point of bruise, but nothing can undo the fact that both of your names are etched into the depths of your soul and are thus	f321d943-2f2d-4145-8327-0ee337288e7c	2025-11-19 18:10:41.803+00	2025-11-19 18:10:41.803+00	f	f	f	\N	f	f
