6z	doc	This is a large undertaking. \n\nI joined Netaris after I heard Greg talking about working on it for a couple weeks. I became pretty interested, so I started talking to him about it. He told me that he had an ambitious vision that was difficult to explain and difficult to make. I joined the project to help him realize this vision. Later, he asked me to join him as cofounder. \n\nMost of my involvement at Netaris is figuring out how to realize different people's visions all at the same time. I became involved in Netaris in the first place to help implement someone else's original vision. Our design persons have a specific vision they want to achieve. I also have a specific vision I want to achieve. It is my job to take these different aspects of the same vision and put them together nicely in something collaborative and coherent. That's what the rest of the following is about:\n	ca82df4d-b69e-4506-89bb-f86531d07d81	2026-02-01 06:37:31.933197+00	2026-02-01 07:08:11.05+00	f	f	f	\N	f	f
