ected. hell, it could end up america's last great export is software (this is a software company right now) like it does in *snow crash*, and it is looking like it's tending towards that but by god i hope it doesn't go that way. you'll still be able to make phone calls. you nor your descendants will ever be offline. and yeah, a few people will raise their kids completely offline, but they're not gonna be offline all their lives. "welcome to the hotel california, you can check out any time you like, but you can never leave".\n\n"teleoplexy, or (self-reinforcing) cybernetic intensification, describes the wave-length of machines, escaping in the direction of extreme ultra-violet, among the cosmic rays. It correlates with complexity, connectivity, machinic compression, extropy, free energy dissipation, efficiency, intelligence, and operational capability, defining a gradient of absolute but obscure improvement that orients socioeconomic selection by market mechanisms, as expressed through measures of productivity, competitiveness, and capital asset value."\n\njoin us on netaris, the new internet.	2025-11-19 05:52:12.696+00	Onboarding	00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
