72	883	- LLC gives W2s to employees, can also be used to *protect* things (like objects) \n- C-corps: \n    - Is better for venture capital \n    - Shareholders are actual owners of cooperation. They elect board, vote on resolutions etc. (big picture things)\n    - Board is elected by shareholders, is responsible for high-level oversight + major decisions (budget, issue stocks, hiring + firing), regular board meetings\n    - one director \n    - multiple corporate officers: CEO, CFO, treasurer, etc\n    - recommendation: separate board people from corporate people\n    - for starting small, can take shareholder and director and corporate officer role\n    - directors vs. corporate officer\n        - directors oversee big picture\n        - corporate officers see day-to-day picture\n	2025-11-21 03:58:09.369+00	Notes from Qian	ca82df4d-b69e-4506-89bb-f86531d07d81
