     | Receive server notices               | Self only           | "                          |\n| +o                | Operator status                      | IRCops (after OPER) | "                          |\n\n## /stats\n\n| Flag | What it does                                                                   | Implemented? |\n| ---- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | ------------ |\n| c    | Returns list of servers the server may connect to or allow connections from    |              |\n| h    | Returns list of servers that are either hub or leaf servers (if hubs are used) |              |\n| i    | Returns list of hosts the server allows clients to connect from (I-lines)      |              |\n| k    | Returns list of banned username/hostname combos (K-lines)                      |              |\n| l    | Returns list of server connections with info on traffic and send               |              |\n| m    | Returns list of commands supported by server and usage count                   |              |\n| o    | Returns list of hosts from which users may become operators (O-lines)          |              |\n| y    | Returns Y-lines (connection class info)                                        |              |\n| u    | Returns uptime of the server                                                   | yes          |\n\n# response codes\n\n| Code                         | Name                 | Description                         |\n| ---------------------------- | -------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| **200s - Trace replies**     |                      |                                     |\n| 200                          | RPL_TRACELINK        | Link info for TRACE routing         |\n| 201                          | RPL_TRACECONNECTING  | Server attempting to connect        |\n| 202                          | RPL_TRACEHANDSHAKE   | Server completing handshake         |\n| 203           