user from channel             | Channel ops                                    | no                    | no                    |\n| AWAY     | Set away message                   |                                                | no                    | yes                   |\n| PRIVMSG  | Send message to user/channel       |                                                | no                    | yes                   |\n| USERHOST | Quick user host lookup             |                                                | no                    | yes                   |\n| NOTICE   | Like PRIVMSG but no auto-reply     |                                                | no                    | yes                   |\n| LIST     | List channels on server            |                                                | no (planned)          | yes                   |\n| WHO      | Query user info                    |                                                | no (planned)          | yes                   |\n| WHOIS    | Detailed user info                 |                                                | no (planned)          | yes                   |\n| WHOWAS   | Info on disconnected user          |                                                | no (planned)          | yes                   |\n| SUMMON   | Write to user's terminal           | If enabled                                     | no (planned)          | no                    |\n| NICK     | Set or change nickname             |                                                | yes (not for client)  | no                    |\n| QUIT     | Disconnect from server             |                                                | yes (not for client)  | yes                   |\n| JOIN     | Join a channel                     |                                                | yes (not for client)  | yes                   |\n| PART     | Leave a channel                    |                                             